OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of textile treasures
OL,4,Apreserved in new project
OL,5,
OL,6,FA treasure trove of thousands of items
OL,7,Fin storage for decades at a mill museum
OL,8,Fin Lancashire are being checked for the
OL,9,Ffirst time and added to a new database.
OL,11,FHelmshore Mills Textile Museum has
OL,12,Fhelped preserve Lancashire's textile
OL,13,Findustry history for the past 40 years.
OL,15,FAs textile firms collapsed in the 1960s
OL,16,Fand 70s, many contents of mills were
OL,17,Fscrapped or sold but the Lancashire
OL,18,FMuseum Service saved items and stored
OL,19,Fthem at the Helmshore museum.
