OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of textile treasures
OL,4,Apreserved in new project
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpinning frames, weavers tools and
OL,7,Fclocking-in machines are among the
OL,8,F4,000 items in storage, which a group
OL,9,Fof trained volunteers are set to
OL,10,Fcatalogue to protect them for future
OL,11,Fgenerations as part of the Cottoning On
OL,12,Fproject.
